    (property "Description" "Cricklewood DPM, 48x29x22 mm, 0-100 V / 0-10 A, supply 4.5-30 V. Five leads: thick red = I in, thick black = I out, thin red = supply +, thin black = supply GND, thin yellow = voltage sense. Shunt in the NEGATIVE leg. Supply comes from +VSW1 so it dies with S1 and cannot flatten the pack in storage"
      (at 0 0 0)
      (show_name no)
      (do_not_autoplace no)
      (hide yes)
      (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
